WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.707 --> 00:00:13.101
Consilia can plan a whole lesson for your class. On Today, press "Let Consilia plan it".

2
00:00:13.101 --> 00:00:16.492
Choose the SoW lesson.

3
00:00:16.492 --> 00:00:29.757
Tell Consilia about your class. Every question is optional, and it remembers your answers for this class.

4
00:00:29.757 --> 00:00:38.804
What matters today? Here: more speaking, and an observation lesson.

5
00:00:38.804 --> 00:00:45.399
Consilia shows how it decided: the framework, the class, and why each activity fits.

6
00:00:45.399 --> 00:00:51.554
Every stage has a step-by-step script, with Low, Moderate and High versions.

7
00:00:51.554 --> 00:00:59.244
Tap a teaching aid to see how to make it, step by step.

8
00:00:59.244 --> 00:01:06.345
Not keen on an activity? Press "Another idea" — only that stage changes.

9
00:01:06.345 --> 00:01:14.370
Press Use this plan. It opens in the builder, scored and ready to edit.

10
00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:16.772
Next: watch "Objectives that pass SMART".
